Error [E3403]: `Clock.now` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> pure_code_rejects_clock_provenance_laundered_through_a_struct.jet:6:25
    |
  6 |     return holder.clock.now()
    |                         ^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine (D-PURE2).
 Fix: Remove this call, or remove the enclosing function's explicit empty effect bound.
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: Clock.now
